<view class="surface-card precision-job-card" aria-labelledby="precision-job-title">
  <view class="card-heading">
    <view>
      <text class="overline">TENANT-ISOLATED RUNNER</text>
      <view id="precision-job-title">精密迁移作业</view>
    </view>
    <StatusChip status="{{job?.status ?? &quot;NOT_RUN&quot;}}" compact="true" />
  </view>
  <view>作业身份来自企业会话；服务端实施租户隔离、活动/存储配额、非覆盖输出、取消、重试、哈希链审计和可恢复归档。</view>
  <view class="form-stack precision-job-form">
    <text>
      <text>Runtime Skill</text>
      <input value="{{skill}}" required="true" pattern="pm-[a-z0-9-]+" bindchange="onChange" />
    </text>
    <view class="form-grid">
      <text>
        <text>模式</text>
        <view value="{{mode}}" bindchange="onChange">
          <view value="assess">assess</view>
          <view value="validate">validate</view>
          <view value="certify">certify</view>
          <view value="transform">transform</view>
          <view value="repair">repair</view>
        </view>
      </text>
      <text>
        <text>只读工作区路径</text>
        <input value="{{workspacePath}}" placeholder="评估 handler 必填；必须位于批准根目录" bindchange="onChange" />
      </text>
    </view>
    <view class="precision-local-auth">
      <view>本地开发认证（生产环境使用企业会话）</view>
      <view class="form-grid">
        <text>
          <text>本地租户</text>
          <input value="{{tenantId}}" autoComplete="off" bindchange="onChange" />
        </text>
        <text>
          <text>本地 Actor</text>
          <input value="{{actorId}}" autoComplete="off" bindchange="onChange" />
        </text>
        <text class="precision-auth-token">
          <text>本地短期 Runner 令牌</text>
          <input type="password" value="{{runnerToken}}" autoComplete="off" bindchange="onChange" />
        </text>
      </view>
      <text>令牌仅保存在当前页面内存中，不写入浏览器存储、作业请求或证据产物。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="business-actions">
      <button class="button button-primary" type="button" disabled="{{busy || !skill.trim()}}" bindtap="onTap">提交作业</button>
      <button wx:if="{{job && !terminal.has(job.status)}}" class="button button-secondary" type="button" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onTap">取消</button>
      <text wx:else>{{null}}</text>
      <button wx:if="{{job && terminal.has(job.status)}}" class="button button-secondary" type="button" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onTap">重试</button>
      <text wx:else>{{null}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="field-error" role="alert">{{error}}</view>
  <text wx:else>{{null}}</text>
  <view wx:if="{{job}}" class="precision-job-result" aria-live="polite">
    <view>
      <text>Job ID</text>
      <code>{{job.job_id}}</code>
    </view>
    <view>
      <text>进度</text>
      <text>
        <text>{{job.progress}}</text>
        <text>%</text>
      </text>
    </view>
    <view>
      <text>执行状态</text>
      <text>{{job.result?.execution_state ?? job.status}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{job.retry_of}}">
      <text>重试来源</text>
      <code>{{job.retry_of}}</code>
    </view>
    <text wx:else>{{null}}</text>
    <view wx:if="{{job.artifacts?.length}}" class="precision-artifacts">
      <text>证据产物</text>
      <text wx:for="{{job.artifacts}}" wx:for-item="artifact" wx:key="artifact.id">{{name ? <button className="precision-artifact-link" type="button" key={artifact.digest ?? name} onClick={() => void download(artifact)}>{name}<small>{artifact.digest?.slice(0, 20)}… · {artifact.size_bytes} bytes</small></button> : null}}</text>
    </view>
    <text wx:else>{{null}}</text>
  </view>
  <text wx:else>{{null}}</text>
  <text class="form-note">UI 只能触发清单中的受控 handler；缺少精确原生或外部能力时会失败关闭，不会执行请求携带的命令。</text>
</view>
